    "section-image-text-dynamicbg": {
      "type": "section-image-text-dynamicbg",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_0666.jpg",
        "heading": "Ceremony starts at the farm",
        "text": "<p>At Pacha Mana, cacao is not a commodity — it's a sacred relationship. We work directly with a multi-generational, family-run collective in the highlands of Peru who cultivate heirloom Chuncho cacao with devotion and care. Grown in harmony with native species, this cacao preserves both culture and ecosystem.</p><p>We believe true ceremonial cacao begins with integrity — from seed to ceremony.</p>",
        "background_image": "shopify://shop_images/sacred_valley_peru.png"
      }
